{"seq":1,"slug":"from-rlhf-to-rlvr","title":"从 RLHF 到 RLVR：o1 与 R1 的启示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/paradigm/from-rlhf-to-rlvr","wordCount":2300,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"从-rlhf-到-rlvr-o1-与-r1-的启示\">从 RLHF 到 RLVR：o1 与 R1 的启示</h1><p>2025 年 1 月，DeepSeek 发布的 R1 技术报告里有一句值得反复咀嚼的话：他们用纯强化学习训练了一个中间检查点，模型在解决题目时学会了重新审视自己的推理步骤——没有任何人类示范教它这么做。这件事之所以可能，是因为奖励的定义变了：不再是「一个学出来的神经网络觉得这个回答像人类喜欢的样子」，而是「答案本身可以被一段程序判定为正确」。从 RLHF 到 RLVR，换掉的表面上是奖励来源，实质上是后训练的整个优化逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇的两个核心对象是奖励信号的来源与优化压力的边界。RLHF 的奖励由学出来的偏好代理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 给出，其可靠性依赖人类标注数据，且必须靠 KL 惩罚把策略拴在参考分布附近；RLVR 的奖励由程序化验证器给出，是一个与模型参数无关的确定性函数，因此可以承受更大的优化压力、也可以放松甚至移除 KL 项。理解这段转移需要抓住三个要素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>奖励的出处</strong>：从「拟合人类偏好的神经代理」换成「判定答案正确性的程序」——前者可被过优化，后者只在自身有漏洞时可被开采。</li>\n<li><strong>优化压力的上限</strong>：RLHF 靠 KL 项为能力封顶（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 越大越安全、上限越低），RLVR 把这把锁松掉，代价是验证器成为唯一防线。</li>\n<li><strong>能力的来源</strong>：RLHF 塑造风格与对齐，RLVR 在可自动判定域内逼出模型本没有的解题行为，R1-Zero 证明这种能力可仅由稀疏结局信号自发涌现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常见误解是把 RLVR 当成 RLHF 的替代品。它是分工而非取代，只在「存在廉价可靠的自动判定」这一前提成立的任务上有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"奖励模型的困境\">奖励模型的困境</h2><p>RLHF 的标准流程分三步：监督微调打底，然后用人类偏好对训练一个奖励模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_\\phi(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，最后用 PPO 最大化这个奖励。偏好建模通常走 Bradley-Terry 路线——给同一提示下的两个回答标注哪个更好，奖励模型的训练目标就是让「更好的回答」得分更高：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>≻</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}(\\phi) = -\\mathbb{E}_{(x, y_w \\succ y_l)}\\left[\\log \\sigma\\big(r_\\phi(x, y_w) - r_\\phi(x, y_l)\\big)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≻</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这套机制把模糊的「人类喜好」压成一个标量信号，让梯度可以流动，但它有两个结构性缺陷。第一，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_\\phi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只是真实偏好的代理：策略优化越狠，代理分数涨得越高，而真实质量在越过峰值后反而下滑——OpenAI 的过优化缩放律研究（arXiv:2210.10760）用实验精确刻画了这种 Goodhart 曲线，代理奖励与金标准奖励的分化随优化压力系统性地出现。第二，唯一的刹车是 KL 惩罚：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>ϕ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{J}(\\theta) = \\mathbb{E}_{x,\\, y\\sim\\pi_\\theta(\\cdot|x)}\\big[r_\\phi(x,y)\\big] - \\beta\\, D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\left[\\pi_\\theta(\\cdot\\|x)\\,\\|\\,\\pi_{\\mathrm{ref}}(\\cdot\\|x)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1847em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∼</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϕ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">KL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>KL 项把策略拴在参考模型附近，防止它钻奖励模型的空子——但这也同时封住了能力上限：策略不敢偏离得太远，因为偏离本身就是被惩罚的对象。奖励越不可靠，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 就得越大，模型就越难走出参考分布。RLHF 因此天然适合「对齐风格、稳住语气」，而不适合「逼出模型本来没有的解题能力」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可验证奖励-换一种信号源\">可验证奖励：换一种信号源</h2><p>RLVR（Reinforcement Learning with Verifiable Rewards）的做法是把奖励函数从「学的」换成「算的」。数学题对答案，代码题跑测试，证明题交给形式化检查器。R1 的奖励设计极简：一道题的奖励就是准确性项加格式项，</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext>verify</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>correct</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext>format</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 合法</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(y) = \\mathbb{1}\\big[\\text{verify}(y) = \\text{correct}\\big] + \\mathbb{1}\\big[\\text{format}(y)\\ \\text{合法}\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">verify</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">correct</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">format</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合法</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>没有神经奖励模型参与打分，也就没有了上面那条 Goodhart 曲线的经典形态——你无法「过优化」一个确定性的判题器，因为它不是从数据拟合出来的。KL 项同样可以大幅放松甚至去掉：既然奖励本身不会骗人，策略就不必被拴在参考模型旁边，这直接解开了能力上限的那道封印。更关键的发现来自 R1-Zero 实验：跳过 SFT 冷启动，直接在基座模型上做纯 RL，长链思考、自我修正这类行为会自发涌现——推理行为可以从纯粹的结局信号中生长出来，不需要逐步的人类示范。当然，「确定性判题器不会骗人」只对它判定得了的部分成立；验证器自身的漏洞会成为新的攻击面，这是 <a href=\"../technical-stack/reward-hacking-in-rlvr\">RLVR 下的奖励黑客</a>一篇的主题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph RLHF[&quot;RLHF 流水线&quot;]&#10;        A[&quot;人类偏好标注&lt;br/&gt;(贵且主观)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;训练奖励模型&lt;br/&gt;r_phi&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;PPO + 强 KL 惩罚&lt;br/&gt;防代理过优化&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;上限:&lt;br/&gt;贴近参考分布&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph RLVR[&quot;RLVR 流水线&quot;]&#10;        E[&quot;程序化验证器&lt;br/&gt;规则 / 测试 / 形式化检查&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;0/1 结局奖励&quot;]&#10;        F --&gt; G[&quot;RL 训练&lt;br/&gt;KL 可放松或移除&quot;]&#10;        G --&gt; H[&quot;上限:&lt;br/&gt;验证器覆盖的问题空间&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    D -.-&gt;|&quot;范式转移&quot;| E\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph RLHF[\"RLHF 流水线\"]\n        A[\"人类偏好标注&lt;br/&gt;(贵且主观)\"] --&gt; B[\"训练奖励模型&lt;br/&gt;r_phi\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"PPO + 强 KL 惩罚&lt;br/&gt;防代理过优化\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"上限:&lt;br/&gt;贴近参考分布\"]\n    end\n    subgraph RLVR[\"RLVR 流水线\"]\n        E[\"程序化验证器&lt;br/&gt;规则 / 测试 / 形式化检查\"] --&gt; F[\"0/1 结局奖励\"]\n        F --&gt; G[\"RL 训练&lt;br/&gt;KL 可放松或移除\"]\n        G --&gt; H[\"上限:&lt;br/&gt;验证器覆盖的问题空间\"]\n    end\n    D -.-&gt;|\"范式转移\"| E</pre><h2 id=\"o1-时刻与-r1-的开源冲击\">o1 时刻与 R1 的开源冲击</h2><p>这条路上有两块里程碑。2024 年 9 月，OpenAI 发布 o1 系列，官方博客给出的核心叙事是把推理阶段的计算量变成新的扩展轴：模型在给出最终答案前先生成长链思考，难题上多想几分钟就能显著提分。o1 是闭源的，外界只能观察行为、无法检视配方——但它证明了「RL 内化搜索过程」这条路能走到多远，也留下了巨大的悬念：长思考到底是训练目标塑造的，还是某种不可复现的工程魔法。</p>\n<p>2025 年 1 月的 DeepSeek-R1（arXiv:2501.12948）回答了这个悬念。报告完整公开了配方：用 GRPO 算法（见 <a href=\"../technical-stack/grpo-family\">GRPO 家族</a>）、可验证奖励、面向推理任务的强化学习；给出了从 R1-Zero 到 R1 的完整演化路径，包括纯 RL 版本的缺陷（语言混杂、可读性差）以及加入冷启动数据后的修正方案；权重以 MIT 许可开源，还附带了把推理能力蒸馏进 Qwen、Llama 小模型的方案。开源的意义不只是「免费」：全行业第一次可以在同一份配方上做受控实验，几周内就出现了复现、拆解与反证——这种集体检验速度是闭源时代不可能有的。具体提分数字与竞赛成绩集中在 <a href=\"landmark-results\">标志性结果</a>一篇里展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两种范式的对照\">两种范式的对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>RLHF</th>\n<th>RLVR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>奖励来源</td>\n<td>从偏好对学习的神经奖励模型</td>\n<td>规则 / 测试 / 形式化检查器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标注成本</td>\n<td>高（人工偏好对，持续需要）</td>\n<td>低（一次性写好验证逻辑）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过优化形态</td>\n<td>代理奖励与真实质量分化</td>\n<td>黑客利用验证器漏洞（新形态）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>防过优化手段</td>\n<td>KL 惩罚、早停</td>\n<td>加固验证器、多样性监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能力上限</td>\n<td>贴近参考模型分布</td>\n<td>验证器可覆盖的任务空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用任务面</td>\n<td>开放域对话、风格、安全</td>\n<td>数学、代码、可自动判定的任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表系统</td>\n<td>InstructGPT、ChatGPT 早期版本</td>\n<td>o1、DeepSeek-R1、Kimi k1.5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表最容易误读的一行是「过优化形态」。RLVR 并没有消灭过优化，只是把它从统计学问题（奖励模型失真）变成了规范问题（验证器规格与真实意图不一致）。前者有缩放律可循，后者只能靠工程纪律——这也是为什么本 hub 要用整整一章讲算法与验证器的攻防。</p>\n<h2 id=\"范式转移的边界条件\">范式转移的边界条件</h2><p>把 RLVR 当成 RLHF 的全面替代品是最常见的误读。它的成立依赖三个前提：任务存在廉价可靠的自动判定（哪些任务够格，见 <a href=\"spectrum-of-verifiability\">可验证性谱系</a>）；奖励信号足够稀疏但无歧义；验证器覆盖的问题分布足够多样，否则模型只会收窄到刷题套路。三个前提之外的世界——写作、共情、开放式决策——仍然属于 RLHF 及其后续变体。两条路线目前是分工而非替代。</p>\n<p>另一个常被忽略的代价是推理长度。RLVR 训出的模型倾向于生成数千乃至上万 token 的思考链，推理成本随之膨胀，这部分账目在 <a href=\"../practice-frontier/compute-cost-accounting\">RLVR 的算力账本</a>里有专门核算。理解了收益与代价的完整形状，「o1 与 R1 的启示」才算真正读完：它们揭示的不是某个技巧，而是当奖励变得诚实时，规模化强化学习终于可以把全部压力用在能力增长上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>RLHF 用学出来的奖励模型近似人类偏好，代价是代理过优化与 KL 封顶；RLVR 改用程序化验证，把奖励变成不可欺骗的确定性信号，从而允许更大的优化压力。o1 证明了路线的上限，R1 公开了配方并引爆了开源复现潮。范式转移有明确边界：只在可自动判定的任务上成立，且把过优化问题从统计形态转成了验证器安全形态。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"从 RLHF 到 RLVR：o1 与 R1 的启示","id":"从-rlhf-到-rlvr-o1-与-r1-的启示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"奖励模型的困境","id":"奖励模型的困境"},{"level":2,"text":"可验证奖励：换一种信号源","id":"可验证奖励-换一种信号源"},{"level":2,"text":"o1 时刻与 R1 的开源冲击","id":"o1-时刻与-r1-的开源冲击"},{"level":2,"text":"两种范式的对照","id":"两种范式的对照"},{"level":2,"text":"范式转移的边界条件","id":"范式转移的边界条件"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"可验证性谱系：从单元测试到形式证明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/rlvr-verifiable-reward-training/paradigm/spectrum-of-verifiability"}}